      "product": {"id":9391194767590,"title":"PURO ROYALE","handle":"puro-royale","description":"\u003cp\u003eStep into the festive season draped in opulence with Pure Royale, a masterful unisex blend from NASO that redefines luxury. Crafted for those who command presence without uttering a word, this fragrance is a bold and sophisticated symphony of depth and elegance.\u003cbr\u003eOpening with a radiant burst of grapefruit and mandarin, Pure Royale invites you in with a citrusy freshness that feels vibrant and celebratory. As the scent evolves, leather and Oudh unveil a rich, smoky sensuality, perfectly balanced by the grounding earthiness of vetiver and the alluring warmth of musk. Finally, patchouli lingers softly, tying the composition together with a touch of timeless mystique.\u003cbr\u003eEach note is thoughtfully layered to create a scent that’s both unapologetically luxurious and strikingly versatile—unisex by design, and magnetic by nature. Whether you're at a festive soirée or an intimate gathering, Pure Royale makes a statement: bold yet refined, familiar yet unforgettable.\u003cbr\u003eTurn heads. Leave a trail. Be Royale.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTop Note: Sweet Mahogany and Cardamom\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHeart Note: Petrichor and jasmine \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBase Note: Patchouli and Oudh\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-08-27T06:17:03-04:00","created_at":"2025-08-26T08:40:53-04:00","vendor":"Naso Profumi","type":"Perfume","tags":["annual2026","Category_Perfume","men","Product_Type_EDP","rakhisale","salejune","YEAREND2025"],"price":300000,"price_min":300000,"price_max":1500000,"available":true,"price_varies":true,"compare_at_price":1500000,"compare_at_price_min":1500000,"compare_at_price_max":1500000,"compare_at_price_varies":false,"variants":[{"id":48294593102054,"title":"20ML","option1":"20ML","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":null,"requires_shipping":true,"taxable":false,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"name":"PURO 