{
      "product": {"id":9391194865894,"title":"ROSE SANTAL 240g","handle":"rose-santal","description":"\u003cp\u003eRose Santal \/ Pure Soy - Like the hue of Noor Jahan, is set in 2023. Delicate, graceful and blooming from the 10th century red rose. Dancing in all the Santal glory this blend is a form of interdependency of Rose with Sandalwood. The power play of the two, light and dark Ingredients, brought together in this unique structure is immaculate. This blend could classify as an all day, only night or an only day blend. This variety of rose brings the bloom in this fragrance balancing the act with the seductive sandalwood. The sound nature of Santal grounds this blend.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe importance of Lucknavi Gulab, Ruh Gulab is considered as the worlds’ most important flower in perfumery today. Rose Santal brings forward the perfect play of light \u0026amp; dark, or some may say masculine and feminine nature of ingredients to light.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Gender - Neutral blend, as a masculine energy while a dim bloom of the feminine rose. \u003cbr\u003eHow to use: Keep the wicks trimmed. This will give you a nice bright flame. Wicks should be one-fourth inch high this ensures an even and smooth flames. Always light to wicks the candle will burn more evenly and youll use the wax more efficiently. Dip your finger tip in the soy oil whilst it burns.Use the pure soy oil on the back of your wrist, inside of your elbow or side of your neck to improve your sleep quality, to calm your anxiety and boost energy.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTop Note: Desi Gulaab\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eHeart Note: Sandalwood\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBase Note: Ruh Gulaab\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-08-27T02:27:24-04:00","created_at":"2025-08-26T08:40:56-04:00","vendor":"Naso Profumi","type":"Candles","tags":["annual2026","Candle 5% tax","Category_Candle","Home","rak